---

<Layout
  title="Cheat Codes"
  fullTitle="Paralives Cheat Codes 2026 – All Cheats Quick Reference (92+)"
  description="Complete Paralives cheat codes list: all cheats for money, needs, skills, career, aging, build mode, and more. Copy any code — Early Access 2026 quick reference."
  canonicalPath="/cheat-codes"
  schema={[faqSchema]}
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[
    { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
    { name: 'Cheat Codes' }
  ]} />

  <header class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">Updated: June 2026</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6">
      All Paralives <span class="bg-[#e11d48] text-white px-3 py-1 border border-black inline-block rotate-[-1deg]">Cheat Codes</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-medium mb-4">
      Complete Paralives cheat codes table. Every listed command in one place — then open specialty guides for money, needs, skills, teleport, trainer, and relationships.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 font-bold">
      New to the console? Start with <a href="/how-to-enable-paralives-cheats" class="text-[#6366f1] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2">how to enable Paralives cheats</a>.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white border-y-[3px] border-black">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full border border-black rounded-2xl overflow-hidden brutal-shadow">
          <thead class="bg-black text-white">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3 text-left font-extrabold text-sm">Category</th>
              <th class="p-3 text-left font-extrabold text-sm">Code</th>
              <th class="p-3 text-left font-extrabold text-sm">Description</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {allCheats.map((cheat, i) => (
              <tr class={i % 2 === 0 ? 'bg-white' : 'bg-[#F9FAFB]'}>
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-sm border-b border-gray-200">{cheat.category}</td>
                <td class="p-3 border-b border-gray-200">
                  <code class="bg-[#6366f1] text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold">{cheat.code}</code>
                </td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gray-700 font-medium text-sm border-b border-gray-200">{cheat.desc}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white border-b-[3px] border-black">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mb-4">Job cheats (career codes)</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Paralives job cheats live in the Career category of this table. Use <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">GETJOB [field]</code> (example: <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">GETJOB Cooking</code>) to assign work, <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">QUITJOB</code> to leave, <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">PROMOTE</code> / <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">DEMOTE</code> to move ranks, and <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">SETJOBLEVEL [number]</code> to jump to a specific level. Select the Para first, open the console, then run the command. Pair with <a href="/money-cheats" class="text-[#6366f1] font-extrabold underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2">money cheats</a> if you also want salary via <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">PAYDAY</code>. For the full career list, filter this page’s table by category <strong>Career</strong>. Early Access builds can rename fields — type <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">HELP</code> if a job id fails.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mb-4">Age up cheat &amp; life stages</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-lg leading-relaxed">
          To age up a Para, use <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">NEWLIFESTAGE</code> for the next life stage, <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">PREVIOUSLIFESTAGE</code> to step back, or <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">SETAGE [years]</code> for an exact age. Infants and teens may also respond to <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">NEXTGROWTHSPURT</code>. Stop aging with <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">DISABLEAGING true</code> (re-enable with <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">false</code>). Always save before <code class="bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">KILL</code> / life-stage jumps. These age-up cheats appear under <strong>Aging</strong> in the table above. For pregnancy-related aging of households, see <a href="/pregnancy-cheats" class="text-[#6366f1] font-extrabold underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2">pregnancy cheats</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-lg leading-relaxed mt-4">
          Detailed money guide → <a href="/money-cheats" class="text-[#6366f1] font-extrabold underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2">/money-cheats</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#F9FAFB] border-b-[3px] border-black">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mb-8 text-center">Related Paralives Cheats</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        {relatedPages.map(page => (
          <a href={page.href} class="bg-white border border-black rounded-2xl p-6 brutal-shadow hover:translate-x-1 hover:translate-y-1 hover:shadow-none transition-all block">
            <h3 class="font-extrabold text-lg mb-1">{page.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium">{page.desc}</p>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#6366f1] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2 text-sm">View Cheats →</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
